" title=\"../batch15/58-df-parameters.md\">../batch15/58-df-parameters.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,M,L\\in V\">\\(C,M,L\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TupleTruth}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TupleTruth}_S\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>, and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"453a692642e0bff9\" href=\"?note=453a692642e0bff9\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-parameters.md\">../batch15/58-df-parameters.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ParameterDefinableClass}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ParameterDefinableClass}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}parameter\\text{-}definable\\text{-}class} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ParameterDefinableClass}_S(C,M,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\\land C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\land\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\;\\exists\\bar a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\;\n\\Bigl(x\\in C\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TupleTruth}_S(M,L,\\varphi,\\langle x\\rangle,\\bar a)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}parameter\\text{-}definable\\text{-}class} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ParameterDefinableClass}_S(C,M,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\\land C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\land\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\;\\exists\\bar a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\;\n\\Bigl(x\\in C\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TupleTruth}_S(M,L,\\varphi,\\langle x\\rangle,\\bar a)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ambient structure, language, formula code, finite parameter tuple, and canonical carrier are explicit. Truth is routed through the sourced tuple-truth relation instead of an unbound <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\models\\varphi[x,\\bar a]\">\\(M\\models\\varphi[x,\\bar a]\\)</span> abbreviation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-parameters.md","status":"resolved","id":"453a692642e